From: Oves786 <30339311+Oves786@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] qualcommbe: enable WCSS Q6 reserved memory on JIDU6J11

The shared JIDU6J11 device tree enables the WCSS remote processor.
Upstream commit 07d8afca2af32368b1c14fb952d7bd1b4773d79c disables
its Q6 reserved memory by default. Enable the region for this board
family without changing the existing address, size or no-map property.

This is a proposed fix and has not been hardware tested.
---
 target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi b/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi
--- a/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommbe/dts/ipq9554-jiorouter-ax6000-jidu6j11.dtsi
@@ -709,4 +709,8 @@
 
 &q6v5_wcss {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&q6_region {
+	status = "okay";
+};
